  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Nǹg轎跤"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳錦月</b></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghl81MwEpwsQ6P0GTsyFbJaZOzaQwNDKvu9Y-lKOCIoZSQSnqchTu-am4u_NkJnOGTf5F2RhFazh0vnqKkgECjx8ZE84g4kYvx-EY5W1K1QqaeZB3XqqJ1ZvGhWAFWSnOy-HJhaH8hTt0BanfJjK3CVAtgFEImKwm6IVnS4_mLfrA7FnsLaKHcKr8h0mQs/s1229/%E5%9C%96%20%E9%99%B3%E9%8C%A6%E6%9C%88%20%E8%BB%81n%C7%B9g%E8%BD%8E%E8%B7%A4.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"874\" data-original-width=\"1229\" height=\"456\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghl81MwEpwsQ6P0GTsyFbJaZOzaQwNDKvu9Y-lKOCIoZSQSnqchTu-am4u_NkJnOGTf5F2RhFazh0vnqKkgECjx8ZE84g4kYvx-EY5W1K1QqaeZB3XqqJ1ZvGhWAFWSnOy-HJhaH8hTt0BanfJjK3CVAtgFEImKwm6IVnS4_mLfrA7FnsLaKHcKr8h0mQs/w640-h456/%E5%9C%96%20%E9%99%B3%E9%8C%A6%E6%9C%88%20%E8%BB%81n%C7%B9g%E8%BD%8E%E8%B7%A4.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下晡，一个人騎oo-tóo-bái去市內se̍h，tī遠遠就有聽著khà鑼拍鼓tshi-tshānn叫ê聲，騎到復興路ê半中站，tshiāng拄tshiāng，tshiāng著人teh ngiâ鬧熱，真濟陣頭sio-tuè，排kah lò-lò長。規tsuā路，人是khó-tsu̍t-tsu̍t。沿路有工作人員交通管制，我hông tsinn kah一隻oo-too-bái suah牽無路好去，規氣kā拄hē路邊，ná看鬧熱ná等in ngiâ--過。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">參加ê陣頭濟kah hōo你看lueh到tè ē目睭花；看童乩褪腹theh leh跳童，伊手提刺球，ná行ná tiô，kha-tsiah-phiann有tiâu血珠仔，hōo我看著ē驚。等有hiah久仔，媽祖主神ê衛護八家將，身軀跳徙、踏跤步，看--起-來「虎虎生風、架勢十足」。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">押後ê媽祖娘娘hit頂轎，tī遠遠接近--來，妝thānn kah tsiânn莊嚴。有一群人跤手真mé，隨行倚入去路中ng，排排做一tsuā，逐个人和齊跪lueh塗跤兜，in看著八家將，一粒一粒le̋-lê-lê ê頭，beh等扛神轎ê人員kā轎thènn-kuân，hānn過in ê頭殼頂。原來in是teh nǹg轎跤--ooh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo我想著細漢，bē記得hit年我幾歲，有一擺，阮萬丹ngiâ媽祖，萬丹鄉36庄頭，每一庄有派出代表家己庄--裡特色ê陣頭，參加tàu鬧熱，有千里眼kah順風耳、宋江陣、弄龍弄獅、踏khiau、車鼓陣、八家將、牛犁歌、公āinn婆……有夠鬧熱。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐口灶門跤口，lóng置香案（tì hiunn-uànn），備辦清茶、敬果、糖仔餅敬拜，mā有tshuân飯湯，涼水、四秀仔……，beh hōo扛神轎、tàu ngiâ鬧熱ê人員食點心，食止iau、止喙ta。阮tsia-ê囡仔，上歡喜神明生ngiâ鬧熱，有tsiok濟hit-lō好料--ê thang食。鬧熱陣hōo我印象上深--ê，是八家將kah千里眼、順風耳。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh ngiâ媽祖進前，阮阿母聽宗族--裡ê tâng-sāi仔leh nauh講：「Nǹg轎跤，ē-tàng hōo媽祖改運、保庇平安。」阮胡--厝hia-ê姆--à、嬸--à，姆婆kāng嬸婆，逐家sio招，講beh tshuā阮一陣囡仔phí nǹg轎跤。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ngiâ媽祖hit工，in就踏話頭，kā阮一陣囡仔千交代萬交代：「Lín看鬧熱ê時，就徛sio倚，做伙蹛路邊等--ha̋nn！」Koh huan咐阮若遠遠看著千里眼、順風耳，he就是押後ê天上聖母媽祖娘娘到位--ah，阮tio̍h-ài緊行倚去路中ng，排hōo好跪--落-來，ài hōo頭殼tshih-tshih！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我看著神轎頂kuân，有寫「天上聖母」四个大字ê轎一下到位，胡--厝一陣大人，tshuā阮一陣lio̍h仔有守規矩ê囡仔，排kah lò-lò長。排tī我後壁ê阿母，tsiok細聲仔hiàm--我：「緊跪--leh、緊跪--leh。」我sī-suā跪--lueh頭tshih-tshih。想hònn玄目睭皮小可仔niauh-kuân，m̄敢直接看，kan-na用目尾偷siam。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">He是我頭一擺上倚近看著八家將ê畫面，hit-lō神祕、威嚇ê氣氛，hōo我感覺一點點仔驚惶。Tng我ê身軀hōo媽祖娘娘ê神轎hānn--過hit目nih，hōo我小小ê心靈，有一種講bē出ê敬畏——tse是我頭一改nǹg轎跤ê經驗。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一年一改ê ngiâ媽祖，是台灣重要ê民間信仰活動，有久長ê傳統，hông指定做國家重要ê無形文化活動資產，八家將mā是台灣文化ê一種代表。Lán人3月23就是媽祖生，台灣逐年lóng有辦媽祖出巡、踩街ûn庄ê活動，mā是民間信仰一个kài對重ê日子。3--月期間，香客人數上濟，iáu有濟濟信眾ē參加nǹg轎跤ê儀式，tsiah有「3--月痟媽祖」ê講法。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjx15cA6ECuwzKL1nJPQaIElv3AVQl-sC6mlzj1Z8tFw7S6Ml7FBSqNCumowf_owU3h1QtZPaMQX9WawXLlB6uPKqzh9eAYrVCH0W6zyi8T4B9oFLvZNT6qAk9ov5xvmzyd3fG4E1M0UDzqfyvQuWFvpMIyrXG89KMf497gxX0V-P0Y-MvYst9cQIt9nFJV/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1373%E6%9C%9F_23.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjx15cA6ECuwzKL1nJPQaIElv3AVQl-sC6mlzj1Z8tFw7S6Ml7FBSqNCumowf_owU3h1QtZPaMQX9WawXLlB6uPKqzh9eAYrVCH0W6zyi8T4B9oFLvZNT6qAk9ov5xvmzyd3fG4E1M0UDzqfyvQuWFvpMIyrXG89KMf497gxX0V-P0Y-MvYst9cQIt9nFJV/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1373%E6%9C%9F_23.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhMNwauoedKcrtCkjYXK3fFS1Bc4_YIUKYqi08giZDKZ56uDJlvCBATdXGmd2QOKwzD04LcpD6RDy04qYZ-2QrCC2139LPwIpXaqU_y2mi8TxzqHGPgpfPmYUiEjDB9-OqTGznNKDEkRrtAvkrz3GTQp4b0GX6qgUZ28LJdfQuRbYgTEusqtRqKBZu7xUtR/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1373%E6%9C%9F_24.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhMNwauoedKcrtCkjYXK3fFS1Bc4_YIUKYqi08giZDKZ56uDJ